{
  "model": "IndexTeam/IndexTTS-2.5",
  "voice": "温暖自然英式女老师｜IndexTTS2.5 慢速教学",
  "pause_seconds": 0.7,
  "chunks": [
    {
      "id": "s23-p01",
      "text": "About 80% of people do not get enough Vitamin D every day.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p01.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p01.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p02",
      "text": "But this vitamin is very important for your health.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p02.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p02.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p03",
      "text": "Vitamin D is really important for our bones.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p03.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p03.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p04",
      "text": "When we are young, vitamin D builds up our bones and makes them strong.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p04.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p04.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p05",
      "text": "When we are older, we still need vitamin D to keep our bones strong.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p05.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p05.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p06",
      "text": "Our bodies keep the vitamin D in our bones and teeth.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p06.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p06.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p07",
      "text": "Then we lose vitamin D as we work and exercise during the day.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p07.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p07.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p08",
      "text": "But our bodies can't make vitamin D.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p08.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p08.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p09",
      "text": "So we have to get it from outside of our bodies.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p09.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p09.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p10",
      "text": "Where can we get this very important vitamin?",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p10.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p10.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p11",
      "text": "Vitamin D is in foods like fish, eggs, cabbages and meat such as beef and pork.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p11.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p11.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p12",
      "text": "Sometimes, vitamin D is added to bread and orange juice.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p12.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p12.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p13",
      "text": "Dairy products like milk, butter and yogurt provide vitamin D as well.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p13.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p13.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p14",
      "text": "We should be sure to eat such foods that are rich in vitamin D when choosing from a menu.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p14.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p14.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p15",
      "text": "Food is not the only way our bodies can get vitamin D.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p15.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p15.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p16",
      "text": "The sun also gives us vitamin D.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p16.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p16.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p17",
      "text": "Too much sun is not good for you.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p17.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p17.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p18",
      "text": "But about 15 minutes a day is usually enough.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p18.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p18.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p19",
      "text": "Living in a flat might limit your sun exposure.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p19.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p19.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p20",
      "text": "So consider using your passport to visit sunny places.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p20.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p20.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p21",
      "text": "Some people may need to take vitamin D pills.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p21.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p21.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p22",
      "text": "You can conveniently get them at a local mall.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p22.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p22.mp3"
    },
    {
      "id": "s23-p23",
      "text": "But it is important to consult a doctor if you think you aren't getting enough vitamin D.",
      "audio": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p23.mp3",
      "sha256": "assets/audio/segments/s23-p23.mp3"
    }
  ],
  "word_audio": "browser speech synthesis en-GB"
}
